          "id": "7a6d66db99b348c6b248116c2d720c8ab8c0f4d1",
          "message": "Scale: a fake project at target size and a nightly scale run (#5497) (#5581)\n\n* Scale: a seeded project at #5486's size and a nightly run measuring each budget (#5497, #4883)\n\nRebuilt on main from #5511 (branch scale-5497-fake-project-nightly-scale-ru-net5kbwx), which\nconflicted after #5556, and again on main after #5565 and #5574. Cargo.lock regenerated by\ncargo; in docs/spec.md, L5 keeps #5556's scale-target wording and #5511's measured-nightly\nstatus. After #5557 the app's program is purlis-app: the scale run's binary paths and pkill\nlines name it, and the bench's appProcess keeps that name.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nAssisted-by: claude-code:claude-opus-5-5\nPurlis-Chat: 01M6SGXH2J6A4FBD3EE9XGND3X\nPurlis-Persona: steward\n\n* Scale spec: the app's program line as Prettier lays it out after the purlis-app rename\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nAssisted-by: claude-code:claude-opus-5-5\nPurlis-Chat: 01M6SGXH2J6A4FBD3EE9XGND3X\nPurlis-Persona: steward\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Aaron Yordanyan <aharon@easydmarc.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
